url: https://github.com/stksk310/NS-P14-Lean
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization project for NS-P14, concerning a comparison of
  total Betti numbers of tangent cones of numerical semigroup rings
  with their interval completions over arbitrary fields. The repository
  includes Lean proofs, Japanese mathematical manuscripts, verification
  scripts, and audit evidence. The unconditional comparison is formalized
  for every numerical semigroup, every field, and every homological degree.
  Run20 and its final independent audit are complete. Original software is licensed under Apache-2.0; original
  manuscripts and explanatory documentation are licensed under CC-BY-4.0.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - numerical semigroups
  - tangent cones
  - Betti numbers
